01C1                             ; ---- console ---------------------------------------------------------------
01C1                             ; 22h pushes the address of the text after it and skips the string.
01C1   E5           H_STR:    PUSH   HL   
01C2   60                     LD   H,B   
01C3   69                     LD   L,C   
01C4   CD CF 02               CALL   skipstr   
